# 统一行尾：仓库里一律 LF，检出到哪个系统都不变。
# 不写这一条时，Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会在检出时把 .gd / .md 换成 CRLF，
# 每次提交都刷一串 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，diff 也会出现假改动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 代码与文本：显式声明，避免被当成二进制
*.gd      text eol=lf
*.tscn    text eol=lf
*.tres    text eol=lf
*.godot   text eol=lf
*.cfg     text eol=lf
*.import  text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.gitignore text eol=lf

# 资源：明确标成二进制，Git 不做行尾转换、不尝试合并
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.webp    binary
*.exr     binary
*.hdr     binary
*.ttf     binary
*.otf     binary
*.glb     binary
*.gltf    binary
*.bin     binary
*.ogg     binary
*.wav     binary
*.mp3     binary
*.zip     binary

# 第三方原始素材：GitHub 语言统计里不计入，免得把仓库标成"素材库"
assets/third_party/** linguist-vendored
docs/screenshots/**   linguist-documentation
